simdjson/** linguist-vendored

# LF in the working tree on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says: the
# build embeds files whose bytes matter (src/jq/builtins/builtin.jq, which
# jq's lexer, which qj's follows, doesn't read with \r as whitespace), and the
# scripts CI runs on Windows are bash. Fixtures that must keep their bytes say
# -text (tests/jq_compat/.gitattributes).
* text=auto eol=lf
